sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as API Consumer
    participant TLS as TLS/mTLS Acceptor<br/>8033/TCP rustls+ring
    participant Filter as Header Passthrough<br/>Filter + Token Rewrite
    participant Router as API Router<br/>(v1/v2 Routes)
    participant Orch as Orchestrator Handler
    participant TGIS as TGIS Generation<br/>gRPC/8033
    participant Chunker as Chunker Service<br/>gRPC/8085
    participant Detector as Detector Service<br/>REST/8080
    participant Health as Health Server<br/>8034/TCP

    Note over Client,Detector: Classification with Text Generation Flow (v1)
    Client->>TLS: POST /api/v1/task/classification-with-text-generation<br/>TLS 1.2+ (optional)
    TLS->>Filter: Decrypt + optional client cert verify
    Filter->>Filter: Filter headers via passthrough_headers allowlist<br/>Rewrite X-Forwarded-Access-Token → Bearer
    Filter->>Router: Validated request with filtered headers
    Router->>Orch: ClassificationWithGeneration task

    par Concurrent downstream calls
        Orch->>TGIS: Generate text (gRPC/tonic)
        TGIS-->>Orch: Generated text response
    and
        Orch->>Chunker: Chunk content (gRPC/tonic)<br/>TLS optional
        Chunker-->>Orch: Chunked segments
    and
        Orch->>Detector: Detect content (REST/reqwest)<br/>TLS optional, Bearer token optional
        Detector-->>Orch: Detection results
    end

    Orch-->>Router: Safety-annotated response
    Router-->>TLS: JSON response
    TLS-->>Client: Encrypted response

    Note over Client,Detector: Streaming Classification Flow (v1)
    Client->>TLS: POST /api/v1/task/server-streaming-classification-with-text-generation
    TLS->>Filter: Decrypt
    Filter->>Router: Validated request
    Router->>Orch: StreamClassificationWithGeneration task
    loop SSE Stream
        Orch->>TGIS: Stream generation (gRPC)
        TGIS-->>Orch: Streamed tokens
        Orch->>Detector: Detect streamed content
        Detector-->>Orch: Detection result
        Orch-->>Client: SSE event (JSON data + keep-alive)
    end

    Note over Client,Detector: Chat Completions Detection Flow (v2, conditional)
    Client->>TLS: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection
    Note right of Router: Only available when OpenAI-compatible<br/>generation service is configured
    TLS->>Filter: Decrypt
    Filter->>Router: Validated request
    Router->>Orch: ChatCompletionsDetection task
    Orch->>TGIS: OpenAI-compatible generation (REST)
    TGIS-->>Orch: Chat completion
    Orch->>Detector: Detect chat content
    Detector-->>Orch: Detection results
    Orch-->>Client: Annotated chat completion

    Note over Health: Health Check Flow (unauthenticated)
    Client->>Health: GET /health (8034/TCP, HTTP, no TLS)
    Health-->>Client: Health status
    Client->>Health: GET /info (8034/TCP, HTTP, no TLS)
    Health-->>Client: Server info
